WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:06.020
So praseodymium is a very interesting element.
It’s got a myriad of uses

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.639
but perhaps the most interesting one is that
it has been used to enable

00:00:09.639 --> 00:00:14.950
us to get within 1/1000th of a degree of Absolute
Zero, which is minus

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:21.940
273 degrees C, which is pretty darn cold.
It was just used in the components which

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:24.710
they were using in the coils to get the temperature
down.

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:30.410
It’s also used in welder’s goggles because
it’s quite good at filtering out

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:34.609
harmful types of light to the human eye, so
you find it’s in the goggle

00:00:34.609 --> 00:00:36.929
and it helps the welder be able to see what
he’s doing.

00:00:36.929 --> 00:00:43.250
It’s also been used in a silicate which
is being used to lower the speed of

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:47.829
light down to a mere 300 metres per second,
which is still pretty fast but

00:00:47.829 --> 00:00:50.899
not very fast compared to the normal speed
of light.

